{"about_the_game":"**English:**<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on an exciting journey inspired by classic games, providing a nostalgic and challenging experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmerse yourself in the action as you navigate the river through diverse biomes, rescuing refugees, and demolishing enemy obstacles along the way. The player's dexterity is crucial to overcoming increasing challenges while facing a variety of adversaries on the mission.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore different airplane models to enhance skills and customize your gaming experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect strategic power-ups to increase the firing rate, bombs for devastating area attacks, and extra lives to prolong your adventure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose between two engaging modes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- **Classic Mode:** Your mission is to traverse the river from start to finish, facing challenging sequences. If you fail, you'll have to restart from the beginning.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- **Mission Mode:** Progress through 50 challenging river missions. Upon reaching the end, an epic battle awaits to defeat enemy forces and free the river's course!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrepare for an intense experience, where your piloting skills will be tested at every river bend. Embark now and become the master of river skies!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Like in the old days.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2777110/81ed831e7b2bb1ac6726496495dace6099fae0dc.jpg"},{"name":"Mission accomplished.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2777110/d7e819715ce60adb258da92953841da7402bc436.jpg"},{"name":"Grass and fresh water!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2777110/222f4b3fa10cf6f98d798cbe8c8941c9661cfc3b.jpg"},{"name":"Protecting the forest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2777110/32605001f41887b4cf93bf14a41ed9a9fc838e1e.jpg"},{"name":"